  "global_rules_applied": [
    "State Composition（AMEND-A）= 每视觉通道单一 Primary Owner；Render Priority Hover>Selected；Visual Salience Selected>Hover",
    "State Color = XY.State.Color.*（原稿 #hex 全部收敛，0 第二真值）",
    "Focus = XY.Focus.Control.*；XYUI-4 只定义 Presentation Variant（C-A3）",
    "Momentary Active 不作为 canonical state → Pressed / Dragging / XY.Resize.*（C-A2）",
    "Persistent Active = 语义族，引用 XYUI-2 ToggleButton ON 语义（C-A2）",
    "Drag 生命周期归 Foundation；Entry = XY.Drag.Entry（Handle|DirectTarget，AMEND-B）；4.11 只做 Presentation（C-A4）",
    "Motion = XY.Motion.*；无任意 ms magic number",
    "Border = XY.Border.Color.* / XY.Border.Width.*；Shadow = XY.Shadow.*",
    "Text = XY.Text.*；Font = XY.Font.UI + XY.FontSize.* / XY.FontWeight.*",
    "Semantic = XY.Semantic.{Success,Info,Warning,Error}.*",
    "LayoutShift = XY.State.ResizeOnChange（Forbidden）",
    "组件独有参数 = COMPONENT_SPECIFIC（不得伪装 Foundation 默认值）"
  ],
